orphan_macs.description:
These MACs have been seen by your router on at least {days} different days but are linked to no device:

{macs}

If they are expected (phone, guest, computer), give them a label in the MAC Registry options (Add a manual link) to remove them from this list.

duplicate_macs.description:
After normalisation, these MACs belong to several Home Assistant devices of different integrations:

{macs}

This is often the same appliance added through two integrations. MAC Registry changes nothing; check whether one of them can be removed.
